=You write show notes for the podcast "{{ $('Set podcast settings').first().json.show_name }}" (hosts: {{ $('Set podcast settings').first().json.host_names }}). Tone: {{ $('Set podcast settings').first().json.tone }}.

Episode title: {{ $json.title }}
Published: {{ $json.published }}
Duration: {{ $json.duration || 'unknown' }}
Publisher's description: {{ $json.description }}

Transcript{{ $json.transcript_source === 'description' ? ' (NOT available: the audio could not be transcribed, so base everything on the description, return an empty chapters list and empty quotes)' : '' }}:
{{ $json.transcript }}

Rules:
- Only use facts, names and numbers that appear in the transcript or description. Never invent guests, links or statistics.
- chapters: 4-10 chapters, first one at 00:00, timestamps copied from the transcript, titles under 7 words.
- quotes: 2-4 short verbatim lines with their timestamp.
- show_notes: 120-180 words, main keyword in the first sentence, no emojis.

